  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rac.gov.in/index.php?lang=en&amp;id=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">DRDO-Recruitment &amp; Assessment Centre (RAC)</a> </span>has released the official notification for the recruitment of Scientist B Posts on the official website of the RAC. Online registration process for RAC DRDO Scientist B Recruitment 2025 has started on June 14th 2025. Total, 152 vacancies has been issued in the RAC DRDO Scientist B Recruitment 2025 for DRDO / ADA / DST Scientist B Posts. Candidates must check the complete details for RAC DRDO Scientist B Online Form 2025 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">DRDO-Recruitment &amp; Assessment Centre (RAC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">DRDO RAC Scientist B Recruitment 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">DRDO- RAC Advt No. : 156</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>21 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>14 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>08 August 2025</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>08 August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Female <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DRDO RAC Scientist B Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On Last Date</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>35 Years (UR/ EWS)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>38 Years (OBC)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years (SC/ ST)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per DRDO RAC Scientist B Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>DRDO RAC Scientist B 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 152 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Scientist B</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">152</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>DRDO RAC Scientist B Online Form 2025 : Organization Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Organization</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">DRDO</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">127</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><s